  "Process terminal control sequences in TEXT using vterm for accurate rendering.

This function creates a temporary vterm buffer to process terminal sequences,
ensuring that all ANSI escape sequences, colors, and cursor movements are
handled correctly with full terminal emulation."
  (condition-case err
      (if (fboundp 'vterm-mode)
          (greger-ui--process-terminal-sequences-with-vterm text)
        ;; Fallback: just insert the text without processing
        (insert text))
    (error 
